OL,3,GNEWSAEurope's largest Chinese garden
OL,4,Aset to open
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe centrepiece of what the RHS
OL,7,Fdescribes as Europe's largest and most
OL,8,Fauthentic classical Chinese garden will
OL,9,Fopen to visitors in Greater Manchester
OL,10,Fon Saturday after more than eight years
OL,11,Fin the making.
OL,13,FThe Yangzhou Scholars' Garden at RHS
OL,14,FGarden Bridgewater in Salford is the
OL,15,Fresult of a collaboration between
OL,16,Forganisations in China, the RHS and
OL,17,FGreater Manchester's Chinese community.
OL,19,FSpecialist craftspeople from China used
OL,20,Ftraditional techniques "rarely seen
OL,21,Foutside China" to create the garden,
OL,22,Fthe RHS said.
OL,23,APub: 25-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
