OL,3,GNEWSAEurope's largest Chinese garden
OL,4,Aset to open
OL,5,
OL,6,FMarcus Chilton-Jones, head of RHS
OL,7,FGarden Bridgewater, described it as a
OL,8,F"lasting symbol of friendship, cultural
OL,9,Fexchange and shared learning."
